WEBVTT

00:53.959 --> 00:55.600
Peace.

01:22.360 --> 01:27.003
And as our classic's in the final summer, we'll

01:27.083 --> 01:31.786
put a little yanny and stroller around. Just

01:32.066 --> 01:38.770
pour and rain on cold blacktop, a spinning life

01:38.910 --> 01:45.594
that has to stop. My voice of shattered, useless

01:45.755 --> 01:51.758
glasses packed away a future past. This

01:52.019 --> 02:00.128
curbstone is an icy throne I've never felt so all

02:00.428 --> 02:06.916
alone Just gotta get to the airport Don't care

02:07.036 --> 02:12.558
how, don't care what it costs A thousand miles

02:12.618 --> 02:19.499
from my safe port A lifeline I can't bear to have

02:19.559 --> 02:27.221
lost This city's just a concrete cage Gotta turn

02:27.241 --> 02:35.432
another page Just gotta get to the airport It's

02:35.512 --> 02:43.154
the only prayer I've got Streetlights

02:43.174 --> 02:50.575
bleed a hazy glare On empty houses standing

02:50.756 --> 02:56.337
there My arms are burning, wheels are slow A

02:56.997 --> 03:03.920
dozen blacks still left to go She'll get down

03:04.120 --> 03:10.585
inside my bones to whisper fears and silent

03:10.786 --> 03:19.253
moans Is anybody watching me? Or am I just too

03:19.513 --> 03:26.280
lost to see? Just gotta get to the airport Don't

03:26.360 --> 03:31.824
care how, don't care what it costs A thousand

03:31.844 --> 03:39.209
miles from my safe port A lifeline I can't bear to

03:39.269 --> 03:46.694
have lost This city's just a concrete cage Gotta

03:46.734 --> 03:54.659
turn another page Just gotta get to the airport

03:55.240 --> 03:57.485
It's the only prayer of God

04:02.695 --> 04:09.959
A flash of faces in my mind The only true north I

04:10.119 --> 04:17.543
can find A sister's love, a steady hand Across

04:17.663 --> 04:26.768
this cold and broken land It's just enough to

04:26.968 --> 04:27.128
keep

04:31.387 --> 04:38.969
to fight and reclaim my own soul.

05:16.731 --> 05:23.195
Airport.

05:27.397 --> 05:31.220
Airport. Gotta get there.

05:36.546 --> 05:41.334
Airport. Airport. Gotta get there.

